@startuml
title Components and layers — implemented Normal and Artillery paths
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Presentation / entry point" {
  component "app.py\nStreamlit navigation" as Entry
  component "view.py\nNormal Shooting widgets/results" as NormalView
  component "artillery_view.py\nartillery inputs/results" as ArtilleryView
}
package "Application" {
  component "controller.py\ncalculate(CombatInput)" as NormalController
  component "artillery_controller.py\ncalculate_artillery_use_case(command, registry)" as ArtilleryController
}
package "Domain" {
  component "model.py\nlegacy abstract binomial chain" as LegacyModel
  component "artillery.py\nArtilleryCommand + exact probability-state transitions\nArtilleryResult / ShootingResult" as ArtilleryDomain
  component "ArtilleryRulesRegistry\nNationArtilleryRules policies" as Rules
  component "domain/inputs.py + typed values\nNormal direct-shooting facts only" as DirectInputs
}
component "NumPy\nlegacy draws + view summaries" as NumPy

Entry --> NormalView : selected Normal
Entry --> ArtilleryView : selected Artillery
Entry --> NormalController
NormalView --> NormalController : CombatInput
NormalController --> LegacyModel : simulate
LegacyModel --> NumPy : binomial sampling
NormalView --> NumPy : histograms/statistics
ArtilleryView --> ArtilleryController : ArtilleryCommand
ArtilleryController --> ArtilleryDomain : calculate_artillery
ArtilleryDomain --> Rules : for_nation / policy calls
ArtilleryView --> Rules : available_unit_rules
DirectInputs ..> LegacyModel : no current application path

note right of ArtilleryDomain
Pure exact probability DP; no RNG or NumPy.
Aggregates equivalent covered-team survivor/morale states
through bombardment and between-turn transitions.
end note

note bottom of Rules
Explicit US, UK, and Japan policy implementations only.
ToT-on-Repeat is rejected; other nation/weapon rules
are not inferred and remain outside supported coverage.
end note
@enduml
